  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Sword.</strong> You wield a blade, using it to unleash devastating attacks infused with spells. You gain the Blacksmithing skill. You gain a +3 bonus to Stamina per echelon, and a +1 bonus to Stability. Additionally, you can use weapon and armor treasures, gain a +1 bonus to the rolled damage of your Melee Weapon abilities, and your Magic Strike abilities gain the Melee and Weapon keywords, with a distance of Melee 1. If you have a kit, you can't take this path.</p>",
